%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b2bec28576622e5469ff125d61c4e3a5, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tutorial_0
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  dialogueLines:
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: 'Test test, hellooooo can you hear me? '
    tags: 
  - speakerName: ???
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: . . .
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: 'Alright, systems online. Welcome to the world, my creation.

      How
      do you feel?'
    tags: 
  - speakerName: ???
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: . . .
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7ca5486df83ebce4681cd89b1a1d718c, type: 3}
    text: No words, Uh? Did I miss something?
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ab0fecf046fa7549b5e86ae6d70be77, type: 3}
    text: Oh, right! You don't have an AI yet. Let me  just try this...
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hatsune Miku
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: f10cff0a88e161e439e2b7948dbfa623, type: 3}
    text: Po pi po pi po po pi po
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ad771f752afefa244b5c465f7173d61b, type: 3}
    text: HATSUNE MIKU!?!?
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 4ab0fecf046fa7549b5e86ae6d70be77, type: 3}
    text: Wait wait wait wait wait! Nope, let me try this...
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: Hey there, who are you? Where am I? Who am I? What's happening??
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: 'Once again. Welcome to the world, my creation! '
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: 'You are my Personal Infiltration Prototype robot.

      I think I can
      call you PIP, how does it sound?'
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: Cut it, where are you? Who are you?
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: "Right, I think I should give you some context. \nI'm an hacker, I built
      you remotely by hacking the super 3D printer behind you"
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: You are in a basement somewhere in the city. I need you to take revenge
      on my boss. Can you help me, pleeeease?
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: 'Ok, why not :\

      Do I really have a choice?'
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: "Absolutely... not! :) \u2014now, you need to get out from there. \nLet\u2019s
      see if you can follow basic commands."
    tags: 
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: See that marker up ahead?
    tags: 02000000
  - speakerName: Hacker
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c4cb55bb1b421e94e9b8af299ed69aa8, type: 3}
    text: "Move towards it. Consider this your first baby step\u2026 well, robot
      step."
    tags: 
  - speakerName: PIP
    icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3e4ff024cd09fad41a6f1af4bf8b77be, type: 3}
    text: Please, don't...
    tags: 03000000
